roid=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者莫雷托消息，皇马正在运作签下曼城中场罗德里。皇马方面相信，罗德里这样的球员能领导球队中场，并且认为罗德里是一名经验丰富的赢家，对于皇马是完美的选择。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-27/69c567588c3e0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：斯凯利主动联系曼联进行了谈判，球员想获得更多出场时间</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/69700ae9272a0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/69700ae9272a0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/69700ae9272a0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者Ben Jacobs消息，他表示，曼联和斯凯利进行谈判的消息属实。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-27/69c5b75701aednative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：拉菲尼亚周五将接受检查确定伤情，极难出战巴西下场热身赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241115/673672f167dd6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img st